DESCRIPTION:Rest - OR optional recovery jog if ALL true: no niggles anywh
 ere\, easy-run HR normal this week\, both strength sessions done. If so:
  5-6 km MAX\, HR capped 140 (~5:50-6:00/km). The pace cap IS the point -
