SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T184500
SUMMARY:🏋️ Strength A — hamstrings/glutes/hips
DESCRIPTION:THIS WEEK: Lighter: drop Nordics this week (race Saturday - o
 nly 4 days out\, keep loads moderate).\n\nSESSION A — heavy posterior 
 chain (hamstrings/glutes/hips). ~40 min:\n1. Romanian deadlift 3×8 (the
  #1 hamstring builder - hinge\, flat back\, feel the stretch)\n2. Nordic
  curl eccentrics - START 2×3\, build to 3×5 over 4 wks (brutal DOMS wh
 en new: Tue ONLY\, never Thu)\n3. Bulgarian split squat 3×8/leg (hip ex
 tension + quad eccentric - doubles as TMB descent prep)\n4. Single-leg h
 ip thrust 3×10/leg (glute max - fixes the underused posterior chain in 
 your gait)\n5. Calf raises 3×12 straight-knee + 3×12 bent-knee (Achill
 es insurance for the volume ramp)\n6. Copenhagen side plank 2×20s/side 
 (adductors - overlooked running stabiliser)\n\nDo 4-6+ hrs after the mor
 ning club session. Skip anything that alters your gait next day.
CATEGORIES:Training,Strength
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
