BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wk16-sat@nyc-marathon-2026
DTSTAMP:20260813T200000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T110000
SUMMARY:🏃 18 km — Long Run (Acadia carriage roads) + fueling rehearsal #2
 
DESCRIPTION:TRIMMED from 24 after Thu threshold overshoot (33 km banked\, 
 cap ~51). Route: Ledgelawn connector → Witch Hole Pond loop → Eagle Lake 
 full loop → home ≈ 18 km crushed gravel.\nEFFORT: HR ≤148 cap\, ignore pa
 ce — roads roll constantly\, power-hike steep 30-sec pitches.\nFUEL (the 
 point of this run): 60 g/hr — gel at every 25-min beep\, ~100 g total\, t
 imer never pauses. GF = domestique.\nBREAKS: 2-3 view stops 2-3 min\, one
  5-min max\, <15 min total stopped. Last 6 km quick-photos-only.\nFoot wh
 ispers mid-run → day over\, bike escort home.\n\n📍 Pin: https://www.googl
 e.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Eagle+Lake+Carriage+Road+entrance%2C+Acadi
 a+National+Park%2C+ME
LOCATION:Eagle Lake Carriage Road\, Acadia National Park\, ME
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Eagle+Lake+Carriage+Ro
 ad+entrance%2C+Acadia+National+Park%2C+ME
CATEGORIES:Training,AcadiaItinerary
END:VEVENT
