BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wk16-str-tue@nyc-marathon-2026
DTSTAMP:20260802T120000Z
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260811T184500
SUMMARY:🏋️ Strength A — hamstrings/glutes/hips
DESCRIPTION:SESSION A — heavy posterior chain (hamstrings/glutes/hips).
  ~40 min:\n1. Romanian deadlift 3×8 (the #1 hamstring builder - hinge\,
  flat back\, feel the stretch)\n2. Nordic curl eccentrics - START 2×3\,
  build to 3×5 over 4 wks (brutal DOMS when new: Tue ONLY\, never Thu)\n
 3. Bulgarian split squat 3×8/leg (hip extension + quad eccentric - doub
 les as TMB descent prep)\n4. Single-leg hip thrust 3×10/leg (glute max 
 - fixes the underused posterior chain in your gait)\n5. Calf raises 3×1
 2 straight-knee + 3×12 bent-knee (Achilles insurance for the volume ram
 p)\n6. Copenhagen side plank 2×20s/side (adductors - overlooked running
  stabiliser)\n\nDo 4-6+ hrs after the morning club session. Skip anythin
 g that alters your gait next day.
CATEGORIES:Training,Strength
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wk16-str-thu@nyc-marathon-2026
DTSTAMP:20260802T120000Z
SEQUENCE:4
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T184500
SUMMARY:🏋️ Strength B — hamstrings/glutes/hips
DESCRIPTION:SESSION B — moderate\, gait + stability (NO heavy eccentric
 s: long run is ~36 hrs away). ~35 min:\n1. Barbell or single-leg hip thr
 ust 3×10 (moderate load)\n2. Step-downs slow 3×8/leg (eccentric quad c
 ontrol - TMB descent prep + knee tracking)\n3. Hamstring bridge walkouts
  or swiss-ball curls 3×8 (hamstring endurance\, low DOMS)\n4. Banded st
 anding hip-flexor march 3×10/leg (hip flexors need STRENGTH too\, not j
 ust stretching - weak+tight is the usual combo)\n5. Lateral band walks 2
 ×15/side + clamshells 2×15 (glute med - single-leg stance stability)\n
 6. Plank 2×45s + side plank 2×30s/side\n\nDo 4-6+ hrs after the mornin
 g club tempo. Moderate effort - leave the gym feeling worked\, not wreck
 ed.
CATEGORIES:Training,Strength
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
