DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260909T100000
SUMMARY:🏃 20 km — Long Run (STRICTLY EASY)
DESCRIPTION:The negotiated long run. The conditions ARE the deal:\n\n- HR 
 CAP 145. Pace lands where it lands (~5:30-5:45). NO finish\, no progressi
 on\, no sub-MP km. If you finish this at 4:45 like the 29\, it was a work
 out\, not a deload.\n- FLAT route. You are about to absorb ~10\,000 m of 
 descent - do not pre-damage the quads.\n- SUPERBLAST. Rebels stay parked 
 until post-TMB.\n- 1 gel around 60 min. Habit\, not need.\n\nGATE: cold f
 irst steps Mon AND Tue. Lateral ankle speaks -> this run is OFF and you f
 ly on a rest week. Judge it cold\, not warm.\n\nPace key: E 5:35-5:55/km 
 | MP 5:00 (gate-decided) | T 4:30-4:35 | HM-eff 4:33\nHR caps: easy/long 
 <=148\, LR ceiling 154
