BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wk20-str-tue@nyc-marathon-2026
DTSTAMP:20260905T120000Z
SEQUENCE:5
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T183000
SUMMARY:🦶 Ankle/calf prehab + mobility (NO heavy legs)
DESCRIPTION:HEAVY STRENGTH IS OFF THIS WEEK. RDLs/Bulgarians/Nordics the n
 ight before a 20 km break your own rule (no heavy legs before a long run)
 \, and DOMS before a 6-day hike is a bad trade.\n\nDO THIS INSTEAD (~30 m
 in\, doubles as TMB prep for the recurring peroneal ankle):\n1. Calf rais
 es 3x15 straight-knee + 3x15 bent-knee\, bodyweight only\n2. Ankle eversi
 on band 3x15/side (PERONEALS - the exact tissue that has flared twice)\n3
 . Single-leg balance 3x45s/side\, eyes closed (proprioception for uneven 
 ground)\n4. Toe-yoga / short-foot 2x10/side\n5. Couch stretch 2x90s/side 
 + 90/90 hip switches 2 min\n6. Foam roll quads/calves 5 min\n\nNothing th
 at makes you sore. If in doubt\, do less.
CATEGORIES:Training,Strength
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
