 is turns into another 4:45 finish it stops being the run we planned.\n\nF
 UEL (the whole point): 8 gels\, 40 g carbs each\, on a 25-MIN REPEATING A
 LARM - elapsed time\, never paused. Beeps continue until the run ends. ~3
 20 g total. This is the first time you go past 2:31 and 200 g.\n\nMANDATO
 RY BAIL: any quad pain\, ankle tingle on load\, or HR drift >8% -> STOP A
 T 24 km. No debate mid-run.\n\nOnly +10% on the 29 km of 5 Sep\, with the
  hike in between as durability work. Superblast.\n\nPace key: E 5:35-5:55
 /km | MP 5:00 (gate-decided) | T 4:30-4:35 | HM-eff 4:33\nHR caps: easy/l
 ong <=148\, LR ceiling 154
CATEGORIES:Training,LongRun
TRANSP:OPAQUE
