 lo TT reads ~1% SLOWER than a race for the same fitness\, so the bar is L
 OOSER than the 1:35 race deal\, not tighter):\n  <=1:36:30 -> 3:25 REOPEN
 S\, race pace 4:51-4:56/km (needs Gates 1-3 green)\n  1:36:30-1:40 -> 5:0
 0/km (3:31)\n  >1:40 -> open 5:05/km\n\nCONDITIONS GATE: readout counts a
 s fair only at T+D <120 F. Above that\, apply the weather table BEFORE re
 ading the result - never temp alone.\n\nEXECUTION REHEARSAL (the actual r
 eason this exists):\n- T-48h: WRITE DOWN target bands + adjusted opening 
 pace from the forecast. Pre-commit.\n- First 3 km HR CAP 165. Non-negotia
 ble. Shaded starts mask effort.\n- Full race kit + race breakfast\, exact
 ly as 1 Nov.\n- ADIOS PRO 2 - this is the foam validation (2 yrs old\, ~1
 00 km).\n- 2 gels\, ~40 min and ~70 min. Intensity fuel test.\n\nCOURSE: 
 Hudson River Greenway out-and-back. Flat\, continuous\, minimal crossings
 .\n\nPace key: E 5:35-5:55/km | MP 5:00 (gate-decided) | T 4:30-4:35 | HM
 -eff 4:33\nHR caps: easy/long <=148\, LR ceiling 154
