DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T060000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T061500
SUMMARY:🎯 Wk 21 (TMB) — 0 run km / hike block
DESCRIPTION:CONFIRMED: Mon 14 - Sat 19 Sep (6 days). Home ~Sun 20/Mon 21.\
 n\nTour du Mont Blanc IS the training. No default running\, no strength. 
 Optional 15-20 min flat Z1 jog on the 2 easiest stages ONLY if morning RH
 R is within 5 bpm of baseline - never the day after the biggest descent.
CATEGORIES:Training,WeekTarget
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wk21-hike@nyc-marathon-2026
DTSTAMP:20260802T120000Z
SEQUENCE:5
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260914
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
SUMMARY:🥾 TOUR DU MONT BLANC — Mon 14 to Sat 19 Sep
DESCRIPTION:This IS training: ~40 h Z1-Z2 time-on-feet + ~10\,000 m of ec
 centric descent = NYC-specific quad durability.\n\nDAILY PROTOCOL:\n- PO
 LES ON EVERY DESCENT (unloads quads 15-20% - highest-leverage choice of 
 the trip)\n- Downhill cue: short quick steps\, land under hips\, 'soft k
 nees - absorb\, don't brake'. Never race the group downhill\n- Carbs 60-
 90 g/hr moving\, 8-9 g/kg/day total\n- Protein 1.8-2.2 g/kg/day - hut me
 als won't cover it\; 25-30 g whey within 30 min of finishing each stage\
 n- Sleep 8+ h\, hand hygiene in huts\, foot care daily\, first 2 days de
 liberately conservative\n\nTHE ONE NON-NEGOTIABLE OF THE WHOLE PLAN: com
 e home uninjured. Everything else has a recovery path\; an ankle here en
 ds the marathon\, not just 3:25.
CATEGORIES:Training,Hike
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
