SUMMARY:🏃 18 km — Easy long-ish (ceiling 20)
DESCRIPTION:Easy\, flat\, HR <=148. Third run back after 6 days of hiking 
 - treat it as such. No quality\, no strides\, no finish.\n\n18 IS THE NUM
 BER. 20 only if Gate 3 passed clean AND Wed jog test + Thu 8 km were both
  silent. You asked for 28 here - declined: this would be your 3rd run bac
 k (6 -> 8 -> 28)\, quads need 7-14 days to repair ~10\,000 m of eccentric
  descent\, and a big run here costs the 32 on 3 Oct. You already did the 
 step-up run - it was the 29 on 5 Sep.\n\nSuperblast. Rebels may return AF
 TER this week if the ankle stayed silent.\n\nPace key: E 5:35-5:55/km | M
 P 5:00 (gate-decided) | T 4:30-4:35 | HM-eff 4:33\nHR caps: easy/long <=1
 48\, LR ceiling 154
CATEGORIES:Training,LongRun
TRANSP:OPAQUE
